  <item>
    <title>15.养老or养“娱”？什么导致机构养老服务的文娱化倾向？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a83f0a42cc2798e7e30c56</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a83f0a42cc2798e7e30c56</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Aug 2025 10:04:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>历史车轮滚滚向前，老龄化越来越严重，生与死的命题将会降临于每一个人身上。阶段性的文娱化，阻挡不了自然的规律。是问题出现了再告诉大家，还是在问题出现之前先做准备？每个人心中都有不同的答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> 国内养老机构星级评定标准解读；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> 评估标准、入住率、短视频风潮导致的社工服务文娱化，间接影响到医疗护理服务；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="658">10:58</a> 有关养老院社工配比的趣事；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 公立与营利性养老院的两条道路（</span><a href="https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20240217A01GC300#:~:text=%E5%9C%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%20%E5%85%BB%E8%80%81%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E4%BB%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F%E6%8E%92%E5%88%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E4%B9%9F%E4%BB%8E%E4%BD%8E%E5%88%B0%E9%AB%98%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E8%B6%8A%E9%AB%98%E5%B0%B1%E6%84%8F%E5%91%B3%E7%9D%80%E5%85%BB%E8%80%81%E9%99%A2%E8%B6%8A%E5%A5%BD%E3%80%82%20%E4%BD%86%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%8C%E7%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E8%BF%99%E6%A0%B7%E5%90%97%EF%BC%9F,%E7%AC%94%E8%80%85%E5%9C%A8S%E5%B8%82%E8%B0%83%E7%A0%94%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E8%AE%A4%E5%AE%9A%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E4%B8%AD%E5%AE%B9%E6%98%93%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9C%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E4%B8%BA%E7%8E%8B%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%95%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F%E3%80%81%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F%E7%AD%89%E5%85%BB%E8%80%81%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E5%BC%BA%E5%9C%A8%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E5%92%8C%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%B9%E6%98%93%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E2%80%9C%E9%87%8D%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E3%80%81%E8%BD%BB%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%20%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E4%BD%8E%E6%98%9F%E7%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%85%BB%E8%80%81%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%8D%E8%80%8C%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E5%9C%A8%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E7%AE%80%E9%99%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E4%B